            "value" : "Dein Konto und seine Daten in allen Ares-Apps werden endgültig gelöscht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your account is created, but the confirmation email didn't go out. %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Konto ist erstellt, aber die Bestätigungs-E-Mail ging nicht raus. %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your account's access to %@ goes. Your data on this iPhone and your Ares account stay." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Zugang deines Kontos zu %@ wird entfernt. Deine Daten auf diesem iPhone und dein Ares-Konto bleiben."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your account's email. You get a link there to choose a new password." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die E-Mail-Adresse deines Kontos. Dorthin bekommst du einen Link, um ein neues Passwort zu wählen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your app version, iOS version and language are sent with it. The answer comes by email, to this address." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App-Version, iOS-Version und Sprache werden mitgeschickt. Die Antwort kommt per E-Mail an diese Adresse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your app version, iOS version and language are sent with it. The answer comes by email, to your account's address." : {
